Catu Daya -> Power On = 5,0 V
          -> Power Off = 0 V

Output Analog Sensor -> Sensor dalam kondisi tanah kering = 0,25V
                     -> Sensor dalam kondisi tanah basah = 3,80V

Output Digital Sensor -> Kondisi di bawah batas pH/threshold = 0 V (LOW)
                      -> Kondisi di atas batas pH/threshold = 5 V (HIGH)
